# Repository-wide line-ending policy.  The 1.1.4 release hit a false
# source_dirty=true in the Ubuntu packaging container because the Windows
# worktree was CRLF while the container expected LF; normalising every text file
# to LF (and keeping batch files CRLF) makes checkouts, Docker builds and CI
# agree.  Run `git add --renormalize .` once to rewrite existing entries.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.nnue binary
*.bin binary
*.pt binary
*.spv binary